        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/33660581127963-Understanding-how-coupons-work-for-Customer-Hub#h_01K0WHG2WTVFPAGPA31B4Z6HSC",
          "text": "Before you begin"
